(5)
Requisition meeting can be only called by Chairperson on a specific issue on the request of minimum 1/3rd of the total
members of the TVC. The meeting will be called within 15 days after receiving the request for the same from the
required number of members;
(6)
The first meeting of TVC will be fixed within 15 days of the publication of the Gazette notification;
(7)
Decision will be taken based on the majority of present members in the meeting. In case of equality of votes, the
Chairperson will have the right of casting vote;
(8)
The Member Secretary will maintain a minute book for recording and proceedings of every meeting and will keep it in his
safe custody. The minute book will record the signature of the members attending the meeting before its
commencement and proper recording of proceedings and resolutions adopted at every meeting will be maintained in the
minute's book. Minute's book would be put up in the subsequent meeting of TVC for confirmation by the Chairperson;
(9)
Quorum - The quorum for the meeting will be at least 1/3rd of the total members of TVC. Meeting will not be carried out
in the absence of the quorum and it will be adjourned;
(10)
Following functions will be discharged in the meeting of TVC :-
(i)
Final Decision about Vending Zones along with their holding capacity as worked out by the local authority;
(ii)
Issuing, withholding, suspending and cancelling of the Vending Certificate;
